<title>INDIA: India Bajaj Auto sets 1:2 bonus issue.</title>
<headline>India Bajaj Auto sets 1:2 bonus issue.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's leading two-wheeler maker Bajaj Auto at a board meeting on Friday set a bonus share issue of one share for every two shares held.</p>
</text>
